%% D12 Model lifecycle state diagram
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Candidate: grid configuration
  Candidate --> Validated: walk-forward CV on dev seasons
  Validated --> Rejected: outside one SE of best
  Validated --> Selected: one-SE rule (simplest adequate)
  Selected --> Calibrated: time-ordered calibration choice
  Calibrated --> Frozen: selection hashed + logged in ledger
  Frozen --> Evaluated: holdout 2025-26 (once)
  Evaluated --> Flagged: too-good guard fires (AUC > 0.72)
  Flagged --> [*]: investigate leakage
  Evaluated --> Registered: refit on all data · SHA-256 recorded
  Registered --> Served: hash verified on load
  Served --> Monitored: prediction_log · PSI drift
  Monitored --> Candidate: drift alert / new season → retrain
  Rejected --> [*]
